---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ArrowLink from '../components/ArrowLink.astro';
import { CONTACTS } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Join us" description="Research opportunities for students interested in black holes, galaxies and X-ray astronomy at USTC.">
  <section class="join-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">Join us</p><h1>Your first research question can start here.</h1><p>Curious about astronomy but unsure whether you are “ready”? You do not need to arrive knowing everything. Bring patience, questions and a willingness to learn how evidence becomes an explanation.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section join-body"><div class="section-inner">
    <header class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">For undergraduates</p><h2>What joining can look like</h2></div><p>A first project is usually small and concrete: learning to read a light curve, checking a catalogue, reproducing a plot or exploring a physical idea with code.</p></header>
    <div class="steps"><article><span>01</span><h3>Explore</h3><p>Read one of our research stories and notice which question you keep thinking about.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Prepare</h3><p>Tell us what interests you, what courses or coding experience you have, and how much time you can realistically commit.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Write</h3><p>Contact the group leader whose interests are closest. A short, specific email is more useful than a formal one.</p></article></div>
    <section class="contacts" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
      <header class="contact-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Ready to talk?</p><h2 id="contact-heading">Contact a group leader.</h2></div><p>Choose the person whose interests are closest to the questions you want to explore.</p></header>
      <div class="contact-list">{CONTACTS.map((contact)=><article><h3>{contact.name}</h3><p>{contact.focus}</p><div class="contact-details"><p><span>Office</span>{contact.office}</p><a class="email" href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a></div><ArrowLink href={contact.homepage} label="Official profile" external /></article>)}</div>
    </section>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  /* Change this background value to experiment with the Join Us hero color. */
  .join-hero {
    background: #BD4444;
    padding: clamp(4.5rem, 7vw, 7rem) var(--pad);
  }
  .join-hero > div { max-width: var(--max); margin: auto; }
  .join-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5.2rem); max-width: 1050px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .join-hero > div > p:last-child { font-size: 1.12rem; max-width: 750px; }
  .join-hero .eyebrow { color: var(--red-dark); }

  .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 4rem); border-top: 1px solid #000; padding-top: 1.6rem; }
  .steps article { padding: 0; }
  .steps span { font: 500 .72rem var(--mono); color: var(--red); }
  .steps h3 { margin: 2.2rem 0 .8rem; }

  .contacts { margin-top: clamp(2.75rem, 4vw, 4rem); border-top: 1px solid #000; padding-top: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem); }
  .contact-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.6fr) minmax(260px, .65fr); align-items: end; gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); }
  .contact-heading h2 { margin: 0; }
  .contact-heading .eyebrow { color: var(--red-dark); margin-bottom: .7rem; }
  .contact-heading > p { max-width: 34rem; margin: 0; }
  .contact-list article { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1.2fr .8fr .8fr; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; padding: 2rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .contact-list h3 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.5vw, 2.6rem); margin: 0; }
  .contact-list p { margin: 0; }
  .contact-details { display: grid; gap: .55rem; }
  .contact-details p { display: grid; gap: .12rem; }
  .contact-details span { font: 500 .62rem/1.2 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--carbon-60); }
  .contact-list .email { color: var(--carbon); text-underline-offset: 3px; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .contact-heading { grid-template-columns: 1fr; align-items: start; }
    .contact-list article { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
    .steps article { padding: 1.4rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .steps h3 { margin: 1.2rem 0 .6rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .contact-list article { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .contact-details { gap: .7rem; }
  }
</style>
